  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) of the region <math><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
